// Dialog :
"P2758083650" "Outstanding! Not only did you keep the Trolls from attacking those Outcast hideouts, but you found an important clue. This list of Outcast hideouts should really help us in the fight to reclaim Cherry Hills."
// RandomFameString :
"P2544064962" "{HeroName} is not afraid of the Trolls!"

