// IntroString :
"P320911188" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Thanks to your work against those Troll raiders, we've got the locations of two Outcast hideouts.</a> The first is an office the Outcasts have been using to store arms. It's led by a Shocker who calls himself the Electric Eel. The second is an abandoned office, led by a Brick known as Bedrock. Intelligence thinks it's likely that Bedrock has a number of dangerous artifacts squirreled away there. Recover them, and you'll have my gratitude."
// AcceptString :
"P418857371" "Invade the Outcast hideouts."
// SendOffString :
"P563579362" "Watch yourself, {HeroName}. The Outcasts aren't keen on invaders."

